  "createdAt": "2026-10-12T11:51:11.839550Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T21:13:45.952817Z",
  "totalBlocks": 77,
  "translatedBlocks": 74,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "650445f79bdc3f57",
      "translationZh": "对于在 AWS 上运行生产工作负载的组织而言，缩短事件检测、调查和修复之间的时间是一项关键优先事项。当问题出现时，值班工程师通常需要迅速诊断涉及多个应用组件的问题，找出根本原因并实施修复，而这些工作往往发生在深夜。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "544921d7f91502be",
      "translationZh": "AWS DevOps Agent 是一个由 AI 驱动的智能体，可基于关联的指标、日志和应用拓扑全天自主对事件进行分诊，通过提供根本原因分析（RCA）和建议的解决措施，满足这一优先事项的前半部分需求。不过，为了保留控制权并帮助防止意外变更，组织通常会让包括 AWS DevOps Agent 在内的可观测性智能体保持在观察并报告模式下。在这种模式下，智能体会诊断问题，但不会直接修改生产资源。在本文中，我们将演示如何使用 AWS Lambda 的一项能力 AWS Lambda Durable Functions，以及 Amazon EventBridge 和 Amazon Bedrock，创建一个自动化修复工作流，作为 AWS DevOps Agent 的补充，完成问题解决步骤。该工作流将调查摘要转化为经过预先验证、只需一次批准操作即可执行的修复方案，帮助您缩短平均解决时间（MTTR），并让值班工程师从重复性的诊断工作中解脱出来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75457a000cb86a9a",
      "translationZh": "借助 AWS Lambda Durable Functions，您可以构建具有弹性的多步骤应用和 AI 工作流，其运行时间最长可达一年，而无需管理额外的基础设施，也无需编写自定义状态管理和错误处理代码。这些函数会自动通过检查点保存进度，在长时间运行的任务期间暂停执行，并从故障中恢复，即使遭遇中断，也能可靠地保留进度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c1ebc5c6a4a39f0",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了解决方案的架构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8aa62f233fe83ac",
      "translationZh": "图 1：从 AWS DevOps Agent 调查开始，经由 Amazon EventBridge、AWS Lambda 和 Amazon Bedrock 的自动化修复工作流，可选择在变更应用到基础设施之前进行人工批准",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef30712b97a33afb",
      "translationZh": "该工作流包含以下步骤：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "980fb5ec4b3e3701",
      "translationZh": "AWS DevOps Agent 完成事件调查，并发出一个包含症状、调查发现和根本原因分析的事件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "268a4316d448c1e8",
      "translationZh": "Amazon EventBridge 接收调查完成事件，并使用调查内容触发 devops-agent-trigger 函数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "81a2eac867f3f36b",
      "translationZh": "Lambda 函数将调查摘要打包，并调用 devops-agent-remediation-durable 持久函数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9b64c148991c43c4",
      "translationZh": "持久函数将调查上下文发送给 Amazon Bedrock，由其分析调查结果并寻找适用的修复方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "08a3e7ac0ff0bb71",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 从经过精心筛选的已批准 Lambda 函数允许列表中识别并列出可用的修复工具：devops-agent-lambda-tool。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f81d5b063311c3ee",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 根据调查结果和可用工具提出具体的修复操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "77163b01d0620531",
      "translationZh": "对于只读操作，持久函数会自主运行修复工具。对于基础设施变更，工作流会暂停，等待人工批准后再继续。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3cc1f0189aa4cd78",
      "translationZh": "获得批准后，持久函数会使用选定的工具对基础设施执行修复操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a3fd977a0eb1440",
      "translationZh": "持久函数以智能体循环的方式运行，反复调用 Amazon Bedrock、执行已批准的工具，并将结果反馈到对话中，直到修复完成。为确保自动化操作安全且可审计，编排器会强制执行一份经过精心筛选的修复工具允许列表。每个工具都是一个专门构建的 Lambda 函数，用于执行范围明确的特定操作，例如读取 Lambda 函数配置，或更新 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 策略语句。Amazon Bedrock 只能从这组已批准的工具中选择并调用工具，从而使自动化操作的范围保持可控。工作流进一步区分只读操作和修改操作。只读工具自主运行，无需人工干预。会修改基础设施状态的修改操作则会使持久函数暂停执行，等待人工批准。这正是 AWS Lambda Durable Functions 的一项关键优势所在。函数通过检查点保存进度，并暂停数分钟、数小时甚至数天，期间不消耗计算资源；收到批准信号后，再从暂停的位置准确恢复执行。当值班工程师介入时，系统已经收集了相关配置，将根本原因与可用的修复操作关联起来，并准备好了一组经过预先验证、可供一键批准的变更。当前实现使用批准或拒绝信号。由于回调接受任意 JSON 载荷，你可以扩展批准机制，使其携带参数覆盖值或审核者意见。这些内容可以反馈到 Bedrock 对话中，以便在执行前完善所提议的修复方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66770a0341cbc4ae",
      "translationZh": "在接下来的章节中，我们将逐步介绍实现细节，包括 Amazon EventBridge 规则配置和持久函数编排逻辑。随后，我们将使用 AWS Cloud Development Kit (AWS CDK) 部署该解决方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a17f0b20e34c4a1e",
      "translationZh": "在部署此解决方案之前，请确认你已满足以下先决条件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "57c844fab9c6d302",
      "translationZh": "已安装并配置 AWS Command Line Interface (AWS CLI)。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "30d2bcdcc1f2a4ef",
      "translationZh": "已安装 AWS CDK。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "957eaea20c2e599e",
      "translationZh": "一个处于活跃状态的 AWS DevOps Agent 空间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aa3e8fb392678f75",
      "translationZh": "（可选）配备 Agent Toolkit for AWS 的 Kiro。Agent Toolkit 通过具有基于 IAM 的访问控制的托管 MCP Server，让 Kiro 能够安全地访问 AWS API。如果你使用 Kiro，本文中的事件模拟、部署和清理步骤都可以通过自然语言提示完成，而无需手动运行 CLI 命令。要进行设置，请将 AWS MCP Server 添加到 ~/.kiro/settings/mcp.json（设置说明）。该代码仓库包含一个 Kiro 规则与智能体文件，可自动为 Kiro 提供项目上下文、部署顺序和安全约定。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8824148e7c1ef30a",
      "translationZh": "模拟事件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd4cc0ba69085784",
      "translationZh": "为了演示端到端工作流程，我们模拟一种常见场景：某个 Lambda 函数的运行时间超过其配置的超时时间。这为 AWS DevOps Agent 提供了一个可供调查的真实事件，并启动了修复工作流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3db7045b1818941",
      "translationZh": "为了将重点放在修复解决方案本身，创建和调用此测试函数的步骤保留在代码仓库中。该仓库包含一个可直接使用的 devops-agent-timeout 函数，以及有关部署该函数、调用该函数并在 Amazon CloudWatch Logs 中确认超时错误的分步说明。完整操作指南请参阅 README 中的“模拟事件”部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c28609c39b7fd13",
      "translationZh": "函数部署完成并产生至少一次超时错误后，你就可以开始使用 AWS DevOps Agent 进行调查了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9e6b4049f33a420a",
      "translationZh": "使用 AWS CDK 部署解决方案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1174b720147ba181",
      "translationZh": "完成以下步骤，部署解决方案的其余资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae99c614c0351a14",
      "translationZh": "Kiro：如果你已配置好带有 Agent Toolkit for AWS 的 Kiro（请参阅先决条件），请在 Kiro 中打开克隆的代码仓库，并提出请求：“设置 Python 环境并部署 CDK 堆栈。在部署之前，向我展示将创建哪些资源。”Kiro 会读取代码仓库中的项目规则，设置虚拟环境，安装依赖项，并在部署前向你展示计划创建的资源。它会在执行前确认每一项基础设施变更，遵循与修复解决方案本身相同的人在回路模式。要手动部署，请按照以下步骤操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5a0902baba503438",
      "translationZh": "克隆托管在 GitHub 上的 AWS CDK 代码：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1e722171df199f33",
      "translationZh": "进入 sample-automate-remediation-post-devops-agent-investigation 目录：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "571c3d49b81c1981",
      "translationZh": "对 AWS CDK 进行引导初始化。首次在特定 AWS 环境（AWS 账户与 AWS Region 的组合）中使用 AWS CDK 时，必须执行此操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf93da66bf5bf915",
      "translationZh": "AWS CDK 会自动预置并配置以下资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9230c35405f02d19",
      "translationZh": "三个 Lambda 函数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f1ebb0d3d7aa0de2",
      "translationZh": "Amazon EventBridge 规则。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a59af6f6c5b94011",
      "translationZh": "AWS CDK 会依据最小权限原则和 AWS 安全最佳实践自动处理 IAM 权限。例如，Amazon EventBridge 被授予针对 devops-agent-trigger 函数的 lambda:InvokeFunction 权限。该堆栈向 devops-agent-trigger 函数授予 aidevops:ListJournalRecords 权限，使其能够从 AWS DevOps Agent 日志中获取调查摘要。它还向 devops-agent-remediation-durable 函数授予 bedrock:InvokeModel 权限，使其能够调用 Amazon Bedrock。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "806f4fd9c4bd5ca3",
      "translationZh": "验证解决方案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5468c5a9b0a49282",
      "translationZh": "修复堆栈已部署，且 devops-agent-timeout 函数因超时错误而执行失败，现在我们可以逐步演示端到端工作流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1ac783854c5979c3",
      "translationZh": "使用 AWS DevOps Agent 启动调查",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61ace3a3f8471fc3",
      "translationZh": "打开 AWS DevOps Agent 控制台，导航到你的代理空间，然后提问：“devops-agent-timeout 函数出了什么情况？”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9608cad5de44dd93",
      "translationZh": "图 2：从 AWS DevOps Agent 控制台启动调查",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd570ae916d6646b",
      "translationZh": "调查随即开始，需要几分钟才能完成。在此期间，AWS DevOps Agent 会自主关联 CloudWatch 指标、日志以及该函数的配置，以确定根本原因。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63422f5ac171140a",
      "translationZh": "图 3：AWS DevOps Agent 在调查期间关联各类信号",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3515f14b76c001d",
      "translationZh": "调查完成后，AWS DevOps Agent 会展示根因分析结果，指出该函数的超时时间不足以满足工作负载的需要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2e58f10bb579308",
      "translationZh": "图 4：根因分析指出函数超时时间不足",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4b6cc58d6503f0aa",
      "translationZh": "验证触发器 Lambda 的执行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89bdb2e9806f04a0",
      "translationZh": "调查完成时，会向 Amazon EventBridge 发送一个 Investigation Completed 事件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d4337ac2bd55ac7",
      "translationZh": "该规则会触发 devops-agent-trigger Lambda 函数，该函数从 AWS DevOps Agent 日志中获取调查摘要。在 /aws/lambda/devops-agent-trigger CloudWatch 日志组中，你可以看到发送给 devops-agent-remediation-durable 持久函数的已解析摘要，其中包括症状、根本原因、促成原因和调查中的信息缺口。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a4f93596f10e09c",
      "translationZh": "图 5：触发函数的 CloudWatch 日志组中已解析的调查摘要",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bf645dd87fd27e20",
      "translationZh": "监控持久函数执行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4764f0ff5d3e5fb8",
      "translationZh": "前往 Lambda 控制台，打开 devops-agent-remediation-durable 函数，然后选择 Durable executions 选项卡。选择新执行以查看其已设置检查点的步骤。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4d93c47bfa5a0c3",
      "translationZh": "图 6：Lambda 控制台中的持久函数执行及其已设置检查点的步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07291fac9fc3e8cc",
      "translationZh": "持久编排器通过向 Amazon Bedrock 发送调查上下文来启动其智能体循环。在第一次 Bedrock 调用中，模型分析调查摘要，并确定在提出修复方案之前，需要检查当前的函数配置。它从允许列表中选择 lambda_get_function_configuration 工具。由于这是只读操作，因此会自主运行，无需人工批准。步骤结果显示了 devops-agent-timeout 函数的当前配置，确认超时值为 3 秒。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "198c876d696a2d87",
      "translationZh": "图 7：只读工具调用返回当前的 3 秒超时配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e812f5e40be58d03",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 提出修复方案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a5b0e8a9d47b105",
      "translationZh": "确认当前配置后，Amazon Bedrock 进入下一轮迭代。它推断 3 秒的超时时间是失败的根本原因，并提议将其增加到 30 秒。Amazon Bedrock 的响应包含推理过程和工具调用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b4fe146298e579a",
      "translationZh": "由于 lambda_update_function_configuration 是一项会修改状态的操作，持久函数会暂停执行并等待人工审批。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14459d6af1c0d2bd",
      "translationZh": "图 8：Lambda 持久函数针对审批请求的 cloudwatch 日志输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5ca21af47b156fa",
      "translationZh": "重要提示：发送给 Amazon Bedrock 的 investigation_summary 以及它提出的修复方案均由 AI 生成，批准前应始终进行审查。人工审批关卡是安全控制措施：审批人必须检查完整的工具参数（例如，lambda_update_function_configuration 调用中的确切 FunctionName 和 Timeout），并确认更改正确。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c1d2fea440c5997",
      "translationZh": "导航至持久执行，选择待处理的回调，然后选择 Send success 以确认：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e08b2e42478b77b7",
      "translationZh": "图 9：在 Lambda 控制台中选择 Send success 来批准修复方案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db063fc22c5021fa",
      "translationZh": "在输入字段中输入 'approved': true，然后确认。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39b30c31908ca202",
      "translationZh": "图 10：输入审批载荷以确认回调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4b77705be968db7",
      "translationZh": "审批通过后，持久化函数恢复执行，调用工具 Lambda 来更新配置，随后 Amazon Bedrock 确认修复已完成。更新后的 devops-agent-timeout 函数现在显示新的超时值：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ac5aece5762f9d3",
      "translationZh": "图 11：devops-agent-timeout 函数的配置已更新为 30 秒超时",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1e740cf1a266837",
      "translationZh": "最后一步的输出（ bedrock-call-4 ）确认修复成功：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ff9e474ee609fd9",
      "translationZh": "从事件检测到自动修复，整个周期只需要工程师执行一次审批操作。系统自主完成了诊断、配置检索、修复方案提出和执行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "959b9e40805663af",
      "translationZh": "完成以下步骤，清理您创建的资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50532c0d3c227a85",
      "translationZh": "Kiro：如果您将 Kiro 与 Agent Toolkit for AWS 配合使用，请提出请求：“清理 DevOps Agent 修复演示中的所有资源：销毁 CDK 堆栈，删除 devops-agent-timeout 测试函数、其 IAM 角色及其 CloudWatch 日志组。”Kiro 会按正确顺序移除资源，并在继续操作前确认每一项破坏性操作。要手动清理，请按照以下步骤操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f04ae3c825868342",
      "translationZh": "删除 AWS CDK 资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f56b76fdffd27ad3",
      "translationZh": "手动删除用于模拟该事件的 devops-agent-timeout 函数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "867c92875e7f750f",
      "translationZh": "手动删除 devops-agent-timeout 函数的 IAM 角色和 CloudWatch 日志组：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb6290ef33246666",
      "translationZh": "本文展示了如何将 Lambda Durable Functions、Amazon EventBridge 和 Bedrock 与 DevOps Agent 配合使用，实现问题修复自动化。该解决方案承接 AWS DevOps Agent 完成的工作，将调查摘要转化为可执行的修复步骤，并在人类参与审批后执行。这种方法缩短了平均解决时间，因为在值班工程师介入时，系统已经诊断了问题、收集了当前配置，并准备好了可供审批的修复方案。安全始终是设计的核心：允许列表限制 Amazon Bedrock 只能调用预先批准的工具，而人工审批关卡有助于防止未经明确授权的意外变更进入生产环境。该架构本身也具备可扩展性。添加新的修复能力只需更新工具注册表中的配置，无需更改编排器的代码。此外，由于 AWS Lambda Durable Functions 在等待审批期间会挂起且不消耗计算资源，即使审批周期长达数小时或数天，该解决方案仍然具有成本效益。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b6fbb88f19e24c1",
      "translationZh": "要开始使用此解决方案，请从 GitHub 仓库下载完整的 AWS CDK 模板，并按照本文中的步骤在您的环境中部署该解决方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edbef46f221cb019",
      "translationZh": "我们很期待听到您的反馈。欢迎在评论中分享您实施此解决方案的经验、提出问题或建议改进。您还可以加入 AWS Community Builders 计划，与其他构建者交流，并分享您的无服务器架构模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
